    "updated_at": "2025-03-25T10:46:55Z",
    "body": "I agree my PR feels a bit *hackish*, however the **canonicalize a domain name** method (with `https` as default scheme) is only called for special URLs. All non special URLs (which including URLs without explicit protocol) are still processed through the **canonicalize a hostname** method. I don't know if its the right behaviour, but I think its consistent the specs.",
